#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2249 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "The SNDIGVER record names the DART 1.1 implementation guide exactly as the rule requires; the second record is a different parameter."
#library standard=sendig version=dart-1-1
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | TS | 1 | SNDIGVER | SEND Implementation Guide Version | SEND DEVELOPMENTAL AND REPRODUCTIVE TOXICOLOGY IMPLEMENTATION GUIDE VERSION 1.1
S1 | TS | 2 | SSTDTC   | Study Start Date                  | 2023-01-01
